  "contract": [
    "ClockCache construction starts no observation. Explicit Refresh calls serialize with context cancellation and an observation deadline.",
    "Read consumes one immutable cached UTC sample and a caller-qualified counter that includes system sleep.",
    "Uncertainty accounts for source error, query delay, both counter errors, and rate drift rounded upward. The actual-age upper bound determines expiry.",
    "Invalidation and unsafe reads fence observations already in progress. Expired evidence cannot revive after a counter reset.",
    "Canceled callers before observation preserve prior evidence. Failed observations clear it.",
    "Native sources, error bounds, host scheduling, and native failure signals still require qualification."
